1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,900
By the way,

3
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,790
Michael was the previous

4
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,230
California Chinese

5
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:33,110
Yo-Yo Junior Division Champion.

6
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:35,100
Very coincidentally,

7
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:37,020
the Jianghai Team Captain, Leo,

8
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:39,420
was also the previous California Chinese

9
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:42,300
Yo-Yo Junior Division Runner-Up.

10
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:44,700
No wonder I saw a Falcon.

11
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,140
What's so great about that?

12
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,030
It's just a bald eagle.

13
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,020
The gap between us and Saint Qiao Team

14
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,940
is 19.97 points.

15
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,310
You two need to score

16
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,780
at least 19.98 to win.

17
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,630
Today, all the Jianghai Team's

18
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,100
hard work and sweat

19
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,980
will rest on your shoulders to bring it to an end.

20
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,860
Maybe it'll end with an Exclamation Mark.

21
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:10,500
Episode 40

22
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,420
Coach Tony is here!

23
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,340
You're all here celebrating.

24
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,740
Yeah, we were just talking about you.

25
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:22,140
Oh, really?

26
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,540
I also brought a friend along.

27
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,980
Will you welcome him?

28
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,900
Welcome? Of course, we will!

29
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,820
Teddy, come on!

30
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:34,620
Teddy?

31
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,860
Can I celebrate with you all?

32
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,740
Of course. You'll always be a
member of the Jianghai Team.

33
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,110
Teddy, you should be happy for everyone

34
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,100
and yourself.

35
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,470
Yeah, the Jianghai Team's Championship

36
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,940
has your sweat and effort too.

37
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:55,260
Leo, I shouldn't have treated you that way before.

38
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,660
Please forgive me.

39
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,540
I was wrong too, and I'll change.

40
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,300
This is the Jianghai Team I've always dreamed of.

41
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:09,180
What, Coach? You dream too?

42
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,540
Of course. Everyone dreams.

43
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:14,940
Why can't a Coach have dreams?

44
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,970
And for your information, Coaches snore too.

45
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:21,300
Haha.

46
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:22,590
Dad's surprise must be here.

47
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:23,580
I'll go see.

48
00:03:24,610 --> 00:03:25,610
Leo.

49
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,340
Let's talk.

50
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,870
Leo, although the Jianghai Team has already won

51
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,820
the Team Championship of this Tournament,

52
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:45,660
I see that Michael is exceptionally strong.

53
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,500
Analyzing the current situation,

54
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,420
the Individual Championship

55
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:53,340
is very likely to be between you and him.

56
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,170
You two are old Rivals.

57
00:03:55,180 --> 00:03:56,220
And also...

58
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,540
The pressure's on, right?

59
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,860
Coach, speaking of pressure,

60
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,260
maybe I would have had some before,

61
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,140
because I wanted to win and I feared losing.

62
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,020
But, not anymore.

63
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:15,420
No matter who I compete against,

64
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:18,300
or whether I win or lose,

65
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:21,180
I won't feel pressure anymore.

66
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,100
Because I know

67
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,020
it's Yo-Yo that brought me to know

68
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,940
so many wonderful friends,

69
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,340
and it's Yo-Yo

70
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:32,220
that let me experience so much joy.

71
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,620
The outcome of a single Competition

72
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:36,540
really doesn't matter that much anymore.

73
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:41,310
Leo, the growth of one's mind and spirit

74
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,260
is far more important than Skill.

75
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,180
I'm very glad you've realized this.

76
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,430
Honestly, I'm also very eager to see

77
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,900
your Eastern Intuition style.

78
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,740
Coach, I won't let you down.

79
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:01,020
Dad's surprise turns out to be Pizza.

80
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,980
Everyone, come and eat!

81
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,860
Oh, Pizza! Awesome!

82
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,780
Coach, Leo, come join us!

83
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:07,740
Come on!

84
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,940
Cheers!

85
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:28,860
Everyone, everyone!

86
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,700
Yesterday's Group Championship was Spectacular.

87
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,540
Congratulations to the Jianghai Team
for ultimately taking home the Crown!

88
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,420
Today, we will be holding

89
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:41,820
the Battle for the Individual Championship.

90
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,420
Based on the Committee's decision,

91
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,340
we have selected the Top 10 Players

92
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,740
with the Highest Scores from yesterday's Group Matches,

93
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,110
to participate in today's Individual Tournament!

94
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,990
Today's Individual Competition

95
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,460
will be conducted in a 'King of the Hill' format!

96
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,380
Whoever holds the hill until the very end,

97
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:08,220
will be crowned the
Individual Champion of this Tournament!

98
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:17,820
Alright, now according to the draw,

99
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,700
we first invite Hugo from
Chengnan Team to defend the hill.

100
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:24,540
Matthew from Jianghai Team will challenge him.

101
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,540
Go, Chengnan Team!

102
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:38,940
Chengnan Team, Number 1!

103
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,380
Go, Hugo!

104
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,780
Chengnan Team, Number 1!

105
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,900
Matthew wins!

106
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,580
Now, Matthew defends the hill.

107
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,320
And Gordon from the Saint Qiao Team challenges!

108
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,180
Matthew successfully defends the hill!

109
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:42,270
Now, Linda from the Saint Qiao Team challenges!

110
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,140
Linda Challenges successfully!

111
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,460
Now, Linda defends the hill.

112
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,380
And Mini from the Jianghai Team Challenges!

113
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,260
Mini Challenges successfully!

114
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,980
Now, Mini defends the hill.

115
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,900
And Jacky from the Chengnan Team challenges!

116
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,620
Mini Successfully defends the hill!

117
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:14,460
Now, Felix from the Xinjian Team challenges!

118
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,660
Now, Felix defends the hill.

119
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,580
And Mark from the Jianghai Team challenges!

120
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:03,900
Mark challenges successfully!

121
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,220
Now, Mark defends the hill.

122
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,620
And Michael from the Saint Qiao Team Challenges!

123
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,980
Michael Challenges successfully!

124
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,260
Next, Michael defends the hill.

125
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,660
Leo from Jianghai Team Challenges.

126
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,420
This place looks familiar, doesn't it?

127
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:01,980
Same place, Same opponent.

128
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:06,300
But the outcome might not be the same this time.

129
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:08,700
Is that so?

130
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:12,060
I hope that here today,

131
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:15,420
I can see the Seventh Color
of your Crimson Holy Light.

132
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,820
No, "The Ultimate Holy Light."

133
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,380
Invincible Eagle

134
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:56,700
Ultimate Holy Light

135
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:02,940
I told you... I'd Surpass You.

136
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:07,740
I now announce...

137
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,180
The 1st Jianghai City

138
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:11,580
Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament...

139
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:15,420
Individual Champion is...
Leo from the Jianghai Team!

140
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:45,000
The End!

